{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"14f12e4c53eaf708","x":-936,"y":-254,"width":5996,"height":10194,"type":"group","label":"Code Design"},
		{"id":"8537bbc30be008bf","x":-335,"y":-229,"width":495,"height":949,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[Start: run_parallel_validation_generation] --> B[Initialize ParallelValidationRulesGenerator]\n    B --> C[Set Concurrency Limits\\n- max_concurrent_tables: 5\\n- max_concurrent_llm_calls: 3\\n- column_batch_size: 10]\n    C --> D[Initialize Connections\\n- Azure OpenAI LLM\\n- MongoDB Collections\\n- Semaphores]\n    D --> E[run_auto_validation_generation]\n    E --> F[Load System Prompt\\nvalidation_prompts/flexible_validation_prompt]\n    F --> G[generate_validation_rules_parallel]\n```\n"},
		{"id":"787b3744dce19e87","x":314,"y":-234,"width":666,"height":954,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    G --> H[discover_all_sources\\nQuery source_collection]\n    H --> I{Sources Found?}\n    I -->|No| J[Return Error: No sources found]\n    I -->|Yes| K[Create Source Processing Tasks]\n    K --> L[Process All Sources in Parallel\\nasyncio.gather with source_tasks]\n\n    %% Parallel execution\n    L -.->|Parallel Execution| L1[Source 1]\n    L -.->|Parallel Execution| L2[Source 2]\n    L -.->|Parallel Execution| L3[Source N]\n\n```\n"},
		{"id":"641c69291888c19f","x":1065,"y":-229,"width":655,"height":1269,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    L --> M[For Each Source: _process_source_parallel]\n    M --> N[Acquire table_semaphore]\n    N --> O[Fetch Tables for Source\\n_get_tables_for_source]\n\n    O --> P{Tables Found?}\n    P -->|No| Q[Return: No tables for source]\n    P -->|Yes| R[Check External Context\\n_get_external_context]\n\n    R --> S[Create Table Processing Tasks\\n_process_table_parallel for each table]\n    S --> T[Process Tables in Parallel\\nasyncio.gather with table_tasks]\n\n    %% Parallel execution\n    T -.->|Parallel Execution| T1[Table 1]\n    T -.->|Parallel Execution| T2[Table 2]\n    T -.->|Parallel Execution| T3[Table N]\n```\n"},
		{"id":"39a3e1729b121534","x":-916,"y":2243,"width":5956,"height":7677,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    %% === Initialization & Setup ===\n    A[Start: run_parallel_validation_generation] --> B[Initialize ParallelValidationRulesGenerator]\n    B --> C[Set Concurrency Limits\\n- max_concurrent_tables: 5\\n- max_concurrent_llm_calls: 3\\n- column_batch_size: 10]\n    C --> D[Initialize Connections\\n- Azure OpenAI LLM\\n- MongoDB Collections\\n- Semaphores]\n    D --> E[run_auto_validation_generation]\n    E --> F[Load System Prompt\\nvalidation_prompts/flexible_validation_prompt]\n    F --> G[generate_validation_rules_parallel]\n\n    %% === Source Discovery ===\n    G --> H[discover_all_sources\\nQuery source_collection]\n    H --> I{Sources Found?}\n    I -->|No| J[Return Error: No sources found]\n    I -->|Yes| K[Create Source Processing Tasks]\n    K --> L[Process All Sources in Parallel\\nasyncio.gather with source_tasks]\n\n    L -.->|Parallel Execution| L1[Source 1]\n    L -.->|Parallel Execution| L2[Source 2]\n    L -.->|Parallel Execution| L3[Source N]\n\n    %% === Table Processing ===\n    L --> M[For Each Source: _process_source_parallel]\n    M --> N[Acquire table_semaphore]\n    N --> O[Fetch Tables for Source\\n_get_tables_for_source]\n\n    O --> P{Tables Found?}\n    P -->|No| Q[Return: No tables for source]\n    P -->|Yes| R[Check External Context\\n_get_external_context]\n\n    R --> S[Create Table Processing Tasks\\n_process_table_parallel for each table]\n    S --> T[Process Tables in Parallel\\nasyncio.gather with table_tasks]\n\n    T -.->|Parallel Execution| T1[Table 1]\n    T -.->|Parallel Execution| T2[Table 2]\n    T -.->|Parallel Execution| T3[Table N]\n\n    %% === Column Batch Processing ===\n    T --> U[For Each Table: _process_table_parallel]\n    U --> V[Acquire table_semaphore]\n    V --> W[Fetch Columns for Table\\n_get_columns_for_table]\n    W --> X[Create Column Batches\\nbatch_size=10]\n    X --> Y[Process Column Batches in Parallel\\n_process_column_batch_parallel]\n\n    Y -.->|Parallel Execution| Y1[Batch 1]\n    Y -.->|Parallel Execution| Y2[Batch 2]\n    Y -.->|Parallel Execution| Y3[Batch N]\n\n    Y --> Z[For Each Batch: Acquire llm_semaphore]\n    Z --> AA[Generate Batch Rules\\n_generate_batch_validation_rules_optimized]\n    AA --> BB[Prepare Optimized Context\\n_prepare_optimized_context]\n    BB --> CC[Create User Prompt\\n_create_optimized_user_prompt]\n    CC --> DD[Query LLM with Retry\\n_query_llm_with_retry]\n\n    DD --> EE{LLM Response OK?}\n    EE -->|No| FF[Retry with Backoff\\nmax 3 attempts]\n    EE -->|Yes| GG[Parse LLM Response\\n_parse_comprehensive_rules_response]\n\n    FF -->|Max Retries Exceeded| QQQ[Log Error & Continue]\n    QQQ --> RR\n\n    %% === Rule Resolution ===\n    GG --> HH[Extract validation_rules Array]\n    HH --> II[Build ID Lookup Maps\\n- table_name_to_id\\n- column_name_to_id\\n- column_to_table_map]\n    II --> JJ[For Each Rule: Resolve IDs]\n\n    JJ --> KK{Rule Scope Level?}\n    KK -->|column| LL[Set column_id + table_id]\n    KK -->|table| MM[Set table_id only\\ncolumn_id=None]\n    KK -->|source| NN[Set IDs=None\\nsource-level rule]\n\n    LL --> OO[Create Formatted Rule Object]\n    MM --> OO\n    NN --> OO\n    OO --> PP[Add Rule to Collection]\n    PP --> QQ[Return Batch Rules]\n\n    QQ --> RR[Collect All Table Rules]\n    RR --> SS[Generate Source-Level Rules\\n_generate_source_level_rules_parallel]\n    SS --> TT[Acquire llm_semaphore for Cross-Table Rules]\n    TT --> UU[Prepare Source Context]\n    UU --> VV[Query LLM for Cross-Table Rules]\n    VV --> WW[Parse Source Rules Response]\n    WW --> XX[Resolve Table/Column IDs]\n    XX --> YY[Combine All Rules\\nColumn + Table + Source]\n    YY --> ZZ[Store Validation Rules\\n_store_validation_rules]\n    ZZ --> AAA[Batch Insert to MongoDB\\nbatch_size=100]\n\n    %% === Final Aggregation ===\n    AAA --> BBB[Release Semaphores]\n    BBB --> CCC[Collect Statistics]\n    CCC --> DDD[Return Source Results]\n    DDD --> EEE[Aggregate All Source Results]\n    EEE --> FFF[Generate Final Statistics\\ntotal_rules, processing_time, success_rate]\n    FFF --> GGG[Close MongoDB Connections]\n    GGG --> HHH[Print Performance Metrics\\nRules/sec, Time/rule]\n    HHH --> III[End]\n\n    %% === Database Collections (for reference) ===\n    subgraph \"MongoDB Collections\"\n        DB1[source_collection]\n        DB2[table_collection]\n        DB3[column_collection]\n        DB4[validation_rules_collection]\n        DB5[context_collection]\n    end\n\n    %% === Concurrency Control ===\n    subgraph \"Concurrency Control\"\n        SEM1[table_semaphore\\nmax_concurrent_tables: 5]\n        SEM2[llm_semaphore\\nmax_concurrent_llm_calls: 3]\n    end\n\n    %% === LLM Integration ===\n    subgraph \"Azure OpenAI\"\n        LLM1[System Prompt Loading]\n        LLM2[Context Preparation]\n        LLM3[LLM Query with Retry]\n        LLM4[JSON Response Parsing]\n    end\n```\n"}
	],
	"edges":[]
}